<title>USA: Argentina's ASTRA Q3 shr higher at $0.035 pesos.</title>
<headline>Argentina's ASTRA Q3 shr higher at $0.035 pesos.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
